<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="description" content="Looking For Party! is a mobile role-playing game by Running Pillow. Explore dungeons, build your character, and team up with other players. Learn how to request account and data deletion.">
  <title>Looking For Party! — Running Pillow</title>
  <style>
    :root { color-scheme: dark; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif; background: #101522; color: #eef1f8; }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body { margin: 0; line-height: 1.7; }
    main { max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 64px 24px 32px; }
    .studio { color: #aebbd2; font-size: .85rem; letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    h1 { font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 7vw, 3.8rem); line-height: 1.12; margin: 20px 0; }
    h2 { font-size: 1.35rem; margin-top: 0; }
    p, li { color: #c7d0e1; }
    .intro { font-size: 1.2rem; max-width: 680px; }
    a { color: #b7d5ff; text-underline-offset: 4px; }
    a:hover { color: #fff; }
    a:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #ffd88a; outline-offset: 5px; }
    .button { display: inline-block; margin: 16px 12px 32px 0; padding: 13px 22px; border-radius: 10px; background: #ffd88a; color: #171b25; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; }
    .button:hover { background: #ffe5b4; color: #171b25; }
    .button.secondary { background: #293750; color: #eef1f8; border: 1px solid #405477; }
    .button.secondary:hover { background: #344565; color: #fff; }
    section { padding: 28px; margin: 20px 0; background: #192234; border: 1px solid #2c3850; border-radius: 16px; }
    section:target { border-color: #ffd88a; }
    ul, ol { padding-left: 22px; }
    footer { margin-top: 36px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #2c3850; color: #aebbd2; font-size: .9rem; }
    @media (max-width: 480px) { main { padding-top: 36px; } section { padding: 22px; } }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main>
    <header>
      <div class="studio">Running Pillow · Indie game studio</div>
      <h1>Looking For Party!</h1>
      <p class="intro">Explore dangerous dungeons, discover powerful equipment, and build your own hero in a co-op roguelike role-playing game for Android.</p>
      <p>Developed by Running Pillow, Looking For Party! brings players together for dungeon runs, tactical turn-based battles, and character progression.</p>
      <a class="button" href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.runningpillow.simplestMMORPG">Get it on Google Play</a>
      <a class="button secondary" href="#delete-account">Delete account or data</a>
    </header>
    <section aria-labelledby="about">
      <h2 id="about">About the game</h2>
      <p>Create a character build from randomized gear and discover combinations that help you overcome challenging encounters. Team up with other players, trade equipment, and compete in a shared player community.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Cooperative dungeon runs and tactical turn-based combat.</li>
        <li>Character builds with varied equipment and powerful synergies.</li>
        <li>Asynchronous PvP against other players’ AI-controlled builds.</li>
        <li>Guilds, leaderboards, and an auction house for trading.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>The game is available on Google Play and includes in-app purchases.</p>
    </section>
    <section id="delete-account" aria-labelledby="deletion-title">
      <h2 id="deletion-title">Account &amp; Data Deletion</h2>
      <p>Players of <strong>Looking For Party!</strong>, developed by <strong>Running Pillow</strong>, can request deletion of their game account and associated personal data, including accounts created through guest sign-in, Google sign-in, or Apple sign-in.</p>
      <h3>How to request deletion</h3>
      <ol>
        <li>Send an email to <a href="mailto:runningpillow@gmail.com?subject=Looking%20For%20Party%21%20-%20Account%20Deletion%20Request">runningpillow@gmail.com</a> with the subject <strong>Looking For Party! - Account Deletion Request</strong>.</li>
        <li>Include your in-game Player ID, if available, so we can locate your account.</li>
        <li>We may ask you to verify account ownership before processing your request.</li>
      </ol>
      <a class="button" href="mailto:runningpillow@gmail.com?subject=Looking%20For%20Party%21%20-%20Account%20Deletion%20Request&amp;body=Hello%2C%0A%0AI%20would%20like%20to%20request%20deletion%20of%20my%20Looking%20For%20Party%21%20account%20and%20associated%20personal%20data.%0A%0AMy%20Player%20ID%20(if%20available)%3A%20%0A%0AThank%20you.">Request Account Deletion</a>
      <h3>What will be deleted?</h3>
      <p>After account ownership has been verified, we will delete your game account and associated game data, such as character progression, inventory, and other account-linked game records. We may retain limited records where required by law, for fraud prevention, or to meet legal obligations; any retained data will be handled in accordance with our <a href="https://runningpillow.github.io/privacy.html">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
      <p>You can also email us to request deletion of specific personal data without requesting deletion of your entire game account. Please describe the data you want deleted.</p>
      <p><strong>Note:</strong> Uninstalling the app does not automatically delete your account or server-stored game data.</p>
    </section>
    <section aria-labelledby="support">
      <h2 id="support">Contact &amp; community</h2>
      <p>For questions about the game, sign-in, or your account, contact Running Pillow at <a href="mailto:runningpillow@gmail.com">runningpillow@gmail.com</a>.</p>
      <p>Share feedback and meet other players in our <a href="https://discord.gg/2AUcDgRY88">Discord community</a>.</p>
    </section>
    <section aria-labelledby="privacy">
      <h2 id="privacy">Privacy</h2>
      <p>Read our <a href="https://runningpillow.github.io/privacy.html">Privacy Policy</a> for information about personal data and privacy. For account or data deletion requests, see <a href="#delete-account">Account &amp; Data Deletion</a>.</p>
    </section>
    <footer>© 2026 Running Pillow · Looking For Party!</footer>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
